==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Charmeleon|8}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Scratch}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Charmeleon}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} Charmeleon.
*'''Ignition''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Crimson Blaze|Charmeleon|12}} from the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

